      "html": "<h2 style='font-size:76px'>Where does the safety live in your current plan?</h2><p style='margin-top:30px'>Hidden in every estimate, owned by one person, or visible to the whole team?</p><hr><p class='mono' style='font-size:28px;line-height:1.8'><span class='accent'>Save</span> this for your next planning session.<br><span class='accent'>Follow</span> @techtaleswithabhi for delivery, architecture &amp; AI — without the hype.</p>",
